  <p id="c-chenshu-029-shenmiaorong-maoxi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-029-shenmiaorong-maoxi:p001:m0000" ref="1ld_xob_aav_A">毛喜</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-029-shenmiaorong-maoxi:p001:m0003" ref="1ld_xob_aav_A">伯武</persName>，滎陽陽武人也。祖<persName id="c-chenshu-029-shenmiaorong-maoxi:p001:m0014" ref="keb_n8x_qsz">稱</persName>，梁散騎侍郎。父<persName id="c-chenshu-029-shenmiaorong-maoxi:p001:m0023" ref="1ld_xob_aav">栖忠</persName>，梁尚書比部侍郎、中權司馬。</p>
